</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bc745f1e-d907-11f1-9c91-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-3b5ba1d6.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bc745f1e-d907-11f1-9c91-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-3b5ba1d6.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d7fd64a4-d904-11f1-8ebe-c1916dc679c1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:29:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US Midterms: Democrats say ready to negotiate and promise big changes</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-us-midterms-democrats-say-ready-to-negotiate-and-promise-big-changes</link><description>
US Democrats are promising to leverage their landslide election win to bring down living costs and hold President Donald Trump's administration to account. They are set to take control of both chambers of Congress in January, but delivering on their agenda could mean striking deals with the very president they have pledged to rein in.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f77a26aa-d909-11f1-aace-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-c858d567.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f77a26aa-d909-11f1-aace-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-c858d567.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ab75ff80-d905-11f1-a283-070a7a1ecbdf</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:22:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Melania Trump urges 'enduring' ceasefire at meeting with Ukrainian, Russian officials</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261105-melania-trump-to-host-ukrainian-russian-officials-at-white-house</link><description>
Russian and Ukrainian officials, including human rights chiefs, met US First Lady Melania Trump at the White House on Thursday ahead of Abu Dhabi talks aimed at ending the Ukraine war. The meeting comes weeks after Melania Trump helped broker a partial ceasefire enabling the evacuation of civilians from the Russian-occupied Ukrainian town of Oleshky.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2321e1d2-d93f-11f1-9d8c-d18c5759e759/w:1024/p:16x9/Melania.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2321e1d2-d93f-11f1-9d8c-d18c5759e759/w:1024/p:16x9/Melania.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">14b7cc80-d8d9-11f1-bab8-c5769b69bd0c</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 05:23:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2321e1d2-d93f-11f1-9d8c-d18c5759e759/w:1024/p:16x9/Melania.jpg">© Alex Brandon, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Truth or Fake</category><title>Trump's second-term playbook: Fake news, AI and attacks on his critics</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/truth-or-fake/20261104-trump-s-second-term-playbook-fake-news-ai-and-attacks-on-his-critics</link><description>
